  endingTitle: Death_Heat
  titleDA: Hede
  descriptionDA: "\xC5h nej! Det var for varmt for pandaen. Den har brug for et k\xF8ligere
    sted for at holde sig sund og rask.\n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger zoologisk have, st\xF8tter
    du et avlsprogram, der er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer! \r\n\r\nOg n\xE5r
    du k\xF8ber bambusprodukter, s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper dig
    med at v\xE6lge produkter, der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet.  "
  titleEN: Heat
  descriptionEN: "Oh no! It was too hot for the panda. It needs a cooler place to
    stay healthy. \n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you support a breeding program that
    helps protect giant pandas! \r\n\r\nAnd when you buy bamboo products, look for
    the FSC label. It helps you choose products made with care for forests and wildlife.  "
